{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1358002-what-destroyed-the-versino-academy","id":1358002,"title":"What destroyed the Versino Academy?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-31T07:30:04-08:00","id":1358002,"title":"What destroyed the Versino Academy?","content":"I'm not sure if I missed it (or forgot it, man, it's been a long time), but I can not remember any official explanation for the destruction of the 1st Imperial Sorcerer Academy, The Versino.<br /> <br /> If there was not official reason given, what head-canon do you like?<br /> <br /> Do you think the Academy's destruction is one of the reasons the Empress &amp; Mnemon had such a chilly relationship?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T08:11:41-08:00","id":1358005,"title":"","content":"According to 1e, Mnemon, by accident, interfered with a 2nd Circle Demon summoning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T11:00:09-08:00","id":1358038,"title":"","content":"Thank you. Do you remember which book that was in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T11:08:08-08:00","id":1358040,"title":"","content":"<i>\u200bAspect Book: Earth</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T11:15:03-08:00","id":1358044,"title":"","content":"Thank you kindly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T11:37:46-08:00","id":1358046,"title":"","content":"Aspect Book Earth has some teachers try to summon a 2CD with the Emerald Thurible. It breaks free, kills everyone but Mnemon (who then steals the Thurible to make sure such a tragedy never happens again). So naturally Mnemon gets blamed, but she had nothing to do with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T12:38:18-08:00","id":1358052,"title":"","content":"She steals the Thurible, just as one of the sorcerers tries to banish it<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T17:51:08-08:00","id":1358113,"title":"","content":"I dug this up just for this thread!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K00EA0C.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800080\">I express my opinions, but YSMV; Your Stories May Vary.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><i>Formerly known as wyrmpuff</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12288-mal-akh","name":"Mal'akh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12288_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T18:07:49-08:00","id":1358114,"title":"","content":"There was a second circle demon being summoned with the thurible, it killed everyone except Mnemon and one powerful monk. Mnemon lived by hiding the monk I think by just being a badass.<br /> <br /> The monk took the emerald thurible and was on the verge of vanishing the demon back to Hell. Unfortunately Mnemon wanted the thirible so she killed the monk just before his victory and banished it herself. She isn\u2019t welcome at the Heptagram mostly because of suspicions that she did shady shit involved with the destruction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-02T03:54:52-08:00","id":1358390,"title":"","content":"I wonder if 3rd edition has retconned this. It seems like something Ragara could've had a hand in especially since his son ended up as the Headmaster of the replacement school.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-02T18:27:48-08:00","id":1358513,"title":"","content":"But then we would not have the image of Mnemon riding away from the Versino with her looted Emerald Thurible. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800080\">I express my opinions, but YSMV; Your Stories May Vary.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><i>Formerly known as wyrmpuff</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12288-mal-akh","name":"Mal'akh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12288_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T17:43:28-08:00","id":1358742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mal'akh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1358002-what-destroyed-the-versino-academy?p=1358513#post1358513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But then we would not have the image of Mnemon riding away from the Versino with her looted Emerald Thurible. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> In her monocycle, preferably. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But i agree with those who say that, i<i>f taking Mnemon's tale at face value </i>she has little to no blame in the incident and the academy's destruction.<br /> Not that spying on her teachers experiments, hiding during the crisis and <b><i>backstabbing the one who did manage to banish the 2nd Circle Demon to loot the Emerald Thurible</i></b> are what one would call exemplary behaviour by any stretch, but it does mean Bhagwei's assessment of her role in the academy's fall is a biased and unfair exageration.<br /> <br /> <i><b>If taking Mnemon's words at face value</b>, </i>that is. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T18:48:07-08:00","id":1358745,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1358002-what-destroyed-the-versino-academy?p=1358742#post1358742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In her monocycle, preferably. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>It's a velocipede in the picture.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T20:19:09-08:00","id":1358757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1358002-what-destroyed-the-versino-academy?p=1358745#post1358745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a velocipede in the picture.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, my bad, brain farts happen.<br /> <br /> As an aside, i don't remember if it is ever said the Versino was created by the Scarlet Dynasty or some remnant of the shogunate era.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 01-03-2020, 11:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-07T06:22:02-08:00","id":1359465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1358002-what-destroyed-the-versino-academy?p=1358757#post1358757\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i don't remember if it is ever said the Versino was created by the Scarlet Dynasty or some remnant of the shogunate era.</div> </div> </div> </div>I first read about it in The Compass of Celestial Directions: The Blessed Isle. They kept the cause of it's destruction a mystery.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Compass of Celestial Directions: The Blessed Isle, pg 115</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once a school of sorcery, the Versino was nowhere near as prestigious as the Heptagram. Indeed, it was the Scarlet Empire\u2019s first attempt at creating a scholastic program. (What better field of study than the supremely dangerous sorcery?) Every precaution was taken, from establishing the place on a remote island far from innocents to making sure that there were no less then 20 Immaculate monks on hand at all times, to aid with spirits and demons and to act as the moral compass for sorcerers of questionable ethics.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mal'akh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1358002-what-destroyed-the-versino-academy?p=1358113#post1358113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dug this up just for this thread!</div> </div> </div> </div>God bless you! I love this image.<br /> <br /> (Cue the Wicked Witch's theme from The Wizard of Oz.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","user":"Daredevil","date":". 01-07-2020, 09:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-07T07:52:33-08:00","id":1359491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1358002-what-destroyed-the-versino-academy?p=1359465#post1359465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I first read about it in The Compass of Celestial Directions: The Blessed Isle. They kept the cause of it's destruction a mystery.<br /> <br /> <i>Originally posted by <b>The Compass of Celestial Directions: The Blessed Isle, pg 115</b></i><br /> <i>Once a school of sorcery, the Versino was nowhere near as prestigious as the Heptagram. Indeed, it was the Scarlet Empire\u2019s first attempt at creating a scholastic program. (What better field of study than the supremely dangerous sorcery?) Every precaution was taken, from establishing the place on a remote island far from innocents to making sure that there were no less then 20 Immaculate monks on hand at all times, to aid with spirits and demons and to act as the moral compass for sorcerers of questionable ethics.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Good, that definitely settles it. Now i'm curious about what centers of sorcerous learning might there have been in the Blessed Isle during the Shogunate - or if sorcerous education at the period was mostly left up to a more ad hoc &amp; individualistic master-apprentice format. No, no, wait, the Sohei, many of them are sorcerers too - so i guess a good chunk of (formal) sorcerous education in the Shogunate might have be taken by the Immaculates of that era.<br /> <br /> Yes, going from what is said in 2e Black &amp; White Treatise, it seems that the education of sorcerers in the Shogunate was officially a function of a branch of the Immaculate and only in the last century has Lookshy started to deviate from that model. How much of that will stand in 3e, if any, i guess we'll haave to wait and see","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 01-11-2020, 10:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}